      "en": "‘You displayed a sensitive spirit[NOTE:1] and humbled yourself before the Lord when you heard how I intended to make this place and its residents into an appalling example of an accursed people.[NOTE:2] You tore your clothes and wept before me, and I have heard you,’ says the Lord.",
